<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34871" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pĕr-erro</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to wander through</i>, <i>to roam</i> or <i>ramble over</i>
				(<b>poet.</b> and in post-Aug. prose).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fallacem circum vespertinumque pererro Saepe
					forum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					S. 1, 6, 113</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">locum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 5, 441</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">freta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					H. 14, 103</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">saltus et fontes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 3, 537</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">orbem, Col. praef. 1: cellas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 97</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">reges,</span>”
				<i>to roam about from one king to another</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 3 praef.</span></i>
			 § 6.— <i>Pass.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arva pererrantur Peligna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Am. 2, 16, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pererratus orbis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. F.
					1, 234</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pererrato ponto,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 2, 295</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">totumque pererrat Luminibus tacitis,</span>”
				<i>surveys all over</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 4, 363</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sonus pererrat cornua, i. e. errat per tubam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					4, 174</span></i>
			.</div>
